A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the strategy game known as '''Sangokushi Rumble''' (三国志乱舞 Sangokushi Ranbu) was held from October 1st, 2013 to October 14th, 2013. The game is published by [https://www.jp.square-enix.com/ SQUARE ENIX].

