==Event==
*'''Collaboration Gacha'''
Characters from [[The Battle Cats]] are available to unlock in the Sangokushi Rumble app via the Rare Capsule/Gacha during the event period. This Gacha consists of:

*[[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]
*[[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]]
*[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]]
*[[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]
*[[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Sumo Cat]]
*[[Samurai Cat (Special Cat)|Samurai Cat]]
*[[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]]
*[[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]
*Jia Xu (Female)

*'''Collaboration Fixed Stage'''
Collaboration Stages are available to play via the Sangokushi Rumble app. The only stage to become available is Kimokawa☆Nyanko.

